Subject: Re: Approximating a scale prior for psi in a SCR model with zero-augmentation (Link 2013 Ecology)
Message-ID: <G_61SxfwBY8.D_r1jiBxiQcJ@hmecology.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <G_61SxfwBY8.kHSrwUBdmdIJ@hmecology.groups.google.com>
